.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-uninstall - Uninstall Orbit CLI binaries and cleanup shell configuration


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit uninstall [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Removes Orbit CLI binaries from system and user paths, cleans shell completions, and optionally purges cache, session, and the owner vault.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Alias for --yes

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for uninstall

.PP
\fB--purge-state\fP[=false]
	Purge cache, session, and owner vault (~/.orbit, ~/.manova, ~/.config/orbit, ~/.config/manova)

.PP
\fB--purge-workspace\fP[=false]
	Purge workspace repositories (blocked if uncommitted changes exist)

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Uninstall without confirmation prompt


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit(1)\fP
